%% Phase2 / post / G-03a 失败消息重试
%% Helix owners: send/flow.rs; send/retry_send.rs; channel/lifecycle.rs; port_reply/dispatch_core.rs; event/post.rs
%% Retry reuses the original temporary_id; no im:post:retrying event is invented.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant PS as PendingSend
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  Note over UI,Sink: 前置状态：首次发送已收到 im:post:send-failed，DB send_status=unsend，保留 temporary_id。
  alt PC Tauri retry
    UI->>Gate: retrySend(messageId)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_retry_send", {messageId})
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI retry
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_retry_send", {messageId})
  else Web retry
    Web->>E: invoke("im_retry_send", {messageId})
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist(load failed row by messageId)
  Host->>DB: Get message + original temporary_id
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(failed row)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  E->>IM: route retry correlation
  IM->>PS: reuse temporary_id，failed -> Local
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist(send_status=sending)
  Host->>DB: update same pending row
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(retry P1, PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(retry P1)
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:sending(same temporary_id)
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/create(retry, same temporary_id)
  IM->>Host: Effect::ScheduleTimer retry_timeout
  Host->>Go: HTTP retry admission
  Go-->>Host: 2xx admission（仍等待 authority）
  Go-->>WS: WS action=post(same temporary_id, server id)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post)
  E->>IM: dispatch post + post_echo_settle
  IM->>PS: reconcile same temporary_id -> server id
  IM->>Host: Persist sent identity
  IM->>Host: CancelTimer retry_timeout
  IM->>Host: PersistAtomic G-01(message + channel + member + cursor)
  Host->>DB: commit and guarded cursor bump
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet channel_member/message
  Host->>DB: readback absolute sender/receiver state
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:received(sendStatus=sent)
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:channel:update
  Sink-->>UI: sender sees sending -> received; receiver sees only received after authority
  Sink-->>FFI: batch raw events
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw events
  alt retry HTTP/Persist failure or second timeout
    IM->>Host: Persist send_status=unsend
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:send-failed
  end
  Note over UI,Web: retry command/accepted 不可替代最终 received；同 temporary_id 幂等对账，失败重试不复制消息。
